            <desc_content>
                <paragraph>A convenience, top-level request method. It uses a module-global <literal>PoolManager</literal> instance.
                    Therefore, its side effects could be shared across dependencies relying on it.
                    To avoid side effects create a new <literal>PoolManager</literal> instance and use it instead.
                    The method does not accept low-level <literal>**urlopen_kw</literal> keyword arguments.</paragraph>
